🎯 SCORING SYSTEM (/10)
═══════════════════════════════════════════

A. MATCH CONTROL PROFILE (max +3)

Strong favorite with high break rate: +2
Opponent weak hold% on surface: +1
Fast-closing profile in recent wins: +1

B. SERVE / RETURN DYNAMICS (max +3)

One elite returner vs weak 2nd serve: +2
One player dominating return points won: +1
Both weak servers = volatility penalty (-1)

C. MATCH RHYTHM PROFILE (max +2)

Average match length below tour average: +1
Low tiebreak frequency last 20 matches: +1

D. RECENT FORM STRUCTURE (max +2)

Check last 5 matches:

Frequent straight-set wins/losses: +2
Many deciding sets: -2
Frequent 7-6 sets: -1

