═══════════════════════════════════════════
🪤 COMMON TRAPS
═══════════════════════════════════════════

FALSE MISMATCH
Big ranking gap ≠ short match automatically.
SERVEBOT ILLUSION
Two big servers can create easy OVER through tiebreaks.
“SAFE FAVORITE” TRAP
Favorite wins often, but in long matches.
RECENT SCORE DECEPTION
6-1 6-2 last round may reflect weak opponent only.
CLAY GRINDER BIAS
Clay specialists often extend matches naturally.

